{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1278334-hedge-beast-companion","id":1278334,"title":"Hedge Beast Companion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-03T09:20:00-08:00","id":1278334,"title":"Hedge Beast Companion","content":"I am comfortably certain that a year or two ago I saw a write-up given by one of the developers for the second edition version of the hedge beast companion merit. I've gotten my backer PDF and apparently the hedge beast companion merit didn't make it into the final copy. I would still like to use the merit but I can't find the post to save my life. Can anyone tell me where to look for the that post??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T09:24:03-08:00","id":1278335,"title":"","content":"I believe the Fey Mount fulfills this purpose?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T14:39:19-08:00","id":1278420,"title":"","content":"I doubt that the original post is still up, but I somewhat obsessively saved preview material because I wanted to be able to see what changed between drafts and finished product.<br /> <br /> Here's the text of that merit:<br /> <br /> Hedgebeast Companion (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Effect: </b>Through friendship or circumstance, the changeling has earned the trust of a creature of the Hedge. These hobgoblins are intelligent enough to converse, but generally don\u2019t stray too far in behavior from the mundane animal they most resemble. This relationship is one of mutual respect or obligation, but isn\u2019t assumed to be bound by pledge. While a pledge is possible, these Hedge Beasts are cunning enough not to enter such a deal by accident.<br /> The Hedge Beast starts with the stats of its closest animal counterpart. By default, it can speak but not read, it has a Mask that allows it to follow the changeling into the mundane world, and it can use trods with the same efficiency as one of the Lost. The supernatural benefits of the beast are built by the following guidlines:<br /> \u2022 Wyrd 1, up to Size 2, Merits up to five points, two dots of Contracts. <br /> \u2022\u2022 Wyrd 2, up to Size 4, Merits up to seven points, three dots in Contracts.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Wyrd 3, up to Size 6, Merits up to ten points, four dots in Contracts.<br /> Note: You can find example animals in the <b>Chronicles of Darkness Rulebook</b>, p. XX.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T06:57:41-08:00","id":1278568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1278334-hedge-beast-companion?p=1278335#post1278335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe the Fey Mount fulfills this purpose?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. Yes the steed is the closest thing in the book to what I'm looking for, but it is a lot more limited than the original merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T07:02:36-08:00","id":1278572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HelmsDerp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1278334-hedge-beast-companion?p=1278420#post1278420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt that the original post is still up, but I somewhat obsessively saved preview material because I wanted to be able to see what changed between drafts and finished product.<br /> <br /> Here's the text of that merit:<br /> <br /> Hedgebeast Companion (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Effect: </b>Through friendship or circumstance, the changeling has earned the trust of a creature of the Hedge. These hobgoblins are intelligent enough to converse, but generally don\u2019t stray too far in behavior from the mundane animal they most resemble. This relationship is one of mutual respect or obligation, but isn\u2019t assumed to be bound by pledge. While a pledge is possible, these Hedge Beasts are cunning enough not to enter such a deal by accident.<br /> The Hedge Beast starts with the stats of its closest animal counterpart. By default, it can speak but not read, it has a Mask that allows it to follow the changeling into the mundane world, and it can use trods with the same efficiency as one of the Lost. The supernatural benefits of the beast are built by the following guidlines:<br /> \u2022 Wyrd 1, up to Size 2, Merits up to five points, two dots of Contracts. <br /> \u2022\u2022 Wyrd 2, up to Size 4, Merits up to seven points, three dots in Contracts.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Wyrd 3, up to Size 6, Merits up to ten points, four dots in Contracts.<br /> Note: You can find example animals in the <b>Chronicles of Darkness Rulebook</b>, p. XX.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! I wish I was foresighted enough to save things like that. Sometimes the write ups that never actually make it into the book appeal to me more than what does (I think I actually preferred the path write-ups for MtA from the pre-release information over what appeared in the book itself).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T07:30:57-08:00","id":1278578,"title":"","content":"I think one reason it wasn't included is that there's a single example animal in the entire CofD book. If they wanted to include Hedgebeast Companion they'd have to remove the last reference and thus have a Merit that required home brewing to be usable in the slightest.<br /> If you want some animals for this Merit you could instead take a look at <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wild-at-heart/\" target=\"_blank\">this semi-official list</a>. Other than that there's a trained guard dog in CofD, p.121 (with simplified dice pools instead of Skills) and a serpent in VtR's Secrets of the Covenants, p.195 (just calculate Health normally instead of what's written and fudge a fitting Toxicity if it's a venomous snake you want).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}